Wed Oct  7 08:38:39 UTC 2026 - Christophe Marin <christophe@krop.fr>

- Update to 1.4.3:
  * tmpnam security mitigations
  Changes in 1.4.2:
  * Fix buffer overflow in outputNChannel
  Changes in 1.4.1:
  * Fix Use-of-uninitialized-value in ReadContainer
  Changes in 1.4.0:
  * Support for memory allocation limit via
    PKAlloc_SetLimit / PKAlloc_GetLimit API
  * Added PKLibJxr_GetVersion API to get library version
  * Fix memory leaks
  * Fix crash in PKImageDecode_Copy_WMP
  * Fix issues found by github Security and quality
  Changes in 1.3.8:
  * Fix DPI conversion accuracy in BMPs
  * Fix compilation error using GCC 15.2
  Changes in 1.3.7:
  * Fix Invalid-enum-value in ParsePFDEntry
  Changes in 1.3.6:
  * Fix Use-of-uninitialized-value in PKFormatConverter_InitializeConvert
  * Fix Use-of-uninitialized-value in ReadWMIHeader
  * Fix buffer read overflow in ReadContainer
  Changes in 1.3.5:
  * Fix some compiler warnings
  Changes in 1.3.4:
  * Fix memory leaks in PKImageDecode_Copy_WMP
  * Fix Null-dereference READ in invTransformMacroblock
  Changes in 1.3.3:
  * Fix memory leak when Caption metadata is present
- Drop jxrlib_warnings.patch, no longer needed
- Update minimum CMake version in custom CMakeLists.txt

